editor_description = "What a body sees: who is inside its sight cylinder (and cone), in name order. Drag the edge of the Shape to change the radius (or set radius_m; 0 = the type's vision_m). The side's sight is the union of the Visions of its bodies (VisionSides). Cost: use_area lets physics filter the candidates; the result is the same."
